e will take you we will drop you on the  way  then you can come back home but they  said they will drop us at the mall  they threw him in the car and i hang on  real tight and then after that it was  time to go  well they were busy talking they were  saying it's time it's time  somebody was just telling them that it's  time to get out we were just praying  loud  when we left here we just prayed loud  we went to the gas station fill up the  cars  we are still praying and then  when we were just not too far  all of a sudden we heard them saying  because they were really communicating  the other car  capsized i don't know what's wrong with  that guy who's driving that car then all  of a sudden they came to us they say  stop praying  that's why this is happening of course  we did stop praying  but i mean we can stop praying  talking loud but we were still praying  another thing that they told us they  said we know we are not bad guys at all  this is the work we are at work right  now  so just like you wake up and go to work  this is the job we are doing this job so  we are not bad guys we are not gonna  rape you we are not gonna do any harm  to you unless you do something  they kept driving and talking  and being nice i mean they knew they  even knew that  isaiah was a diabetic so he had  they had his bag they gave me whatever  was in his bag  candy but we were sharing candy we were  we never saw their faces because  they they just told us that you don't  look at them  and the guys that were in with us in the  car really they  they didn't even have their faces  covered they were changing the  the drivers from here to pelhan daba we  had a different driver  and then from there we had another  driver so i could hear when they were  talking about those places  plus where i think when we were getting  to sotona bay  they said it was okay for me i could sit  up  in the car but not still with my head  down  then when we got to mongoose that's when  they started they left  the